Available commands:
- help - Displays this screen.
- dumpht [<type>] - Dumps all handles of <type> or lists all types
- handle <handle> - Displays information about a handle
- entry <entry> - Displays an ENTRY, <entry> can be a pointer or index
- baseobject <object> - Displays a BASEOBJECT
